      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply the given properties to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/view/AbstractTemplateViewResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.view\"><code>AbstractTemplateViewResolver</code></a>. Use Object in\nsignature to avoid runtime dependency on MVC, which means that the template engine\ncan be used in a non-web application.",
      "translation": "将给定属性应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/view/AbstractTemplateViewResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.view\"><code>AbstractTemplateViewResolver</code></a>。在签名中使用 Object 以避免运行时对 MVC 的依赖，这意味着模板引擎可以在非 Web 应用程序中使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
